docs {
  # C2B Confirmation
  
  Called by Safaricom AFTER successful C2B payment processing.
  
  ## When Called
  After customer sends money to your PayBill/Till number and validation passes.
  
  ## Data Includes
  - Transaction receipt number
  - Customer details (name, phone)
  - Amount paid
  - Account/bill reference number
  - New account balance
  
  ## Action Required
  - Save transaction to database
  - Credit customer account
  - Send confirmation notification
  
  **Note**: Always return success response to acknowledge receipt.
}
